<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Cambria;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #1F497D;  --docx-lt2-color: #EEECE1;  --docx-accent1-color: #4F81BD;  --docx-accent2-color: #C0504D;  --docx-accent3-color: #9BBB59;  --docx-accent4-color: #8064A2;  --docx-accent5-color: #4BACC6;  --docx-accent6-color: #F79646;  --docx-hlink-color: #0000FF;  --docx-folhlink-color: #800080;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Calibri;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: Calibri;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_2 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; text-indent: 21pt; margin-left: 10pt; margin-right: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US">为强化学生目标引领和专业引领，促进学业发展，明晰人生目标，本科生导师进社区系列分享交流活动正在持续进行。第六周，高年级学生社区（2021级）共举办分享交流活动6期，6位老师进驻社区，为学生进行更专业、更前沿、更具深度的学术引领。让我们一起来回顾一下本周精彩的导学现场吧！</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US">3月24日周一/五号楼前沿交叉院 符吉祥如何利用AI工具高质量完成毕业设计任务</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 207pt; height: 155.25pt;"><img src="/__local/4/94/CC/091AE5E1ED8E9C8241BC98B699A_6CEF8203_1C6DA.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/494CC091AE5E1ED8E9C8241BC98B699A/6CEF8203/1C6DA" vheight=" 155.25pt" vwidth=" 207pt" orisrc="/__local/2/3F/5E/F64BD78079AF3975153F690501F_731CC1EF_4C59C.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 207pt; height: 155.25pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US">3月26日周三/五号楼数学与统计学院 高志鹏&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;马氏过程及其应用，论文写作指导</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 207pt; height: 155.2pt;"><img src="/__local/1/BD/EB/31762E5C780DA066F796739837A_1EF2E3D4_1805E.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/1BDEB31762E5C780DA066F796739837A/1EF2E3D4/1805E" vheight=" 155.25pt" vwidth=" 207pt" orisrc="/__local/6/46/54/02D016275501A635B1C2AB1B144_F764F8F0_365DC.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 207pt; height: 155.25pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US">3月27日周四/五号楼数学与统计学院 李童庆偏微分方程反问题简介，论文写作指导</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 207pt; height: 155.15pt;"><img src="/__local/F/FB/7E/F9DE66F4475721AC239667FEC01_2E521DB7_199FC.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/FFB7EF9DE66F4475721AC239667FEC01/2E521DB7/199FC" vheight=" 155.16pt" vwidth=" 207pt" orisrc="/__local/1/3F/03/F7CB4C1DBDB7CF315118A3131E4_EE145442_43E42.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 207pt; height: 155.16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US">3月27日周四/五号楼先进材料与纳米科技学院 苏晨如何写好毕设论文</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 207pt; height: 155.25pt;"><img src="/__local/C/39/D1/7E990FE2F451B00DF5A288B374E_AF794FA2_1AA15.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/C39D17E990FE2F451B00DF5A288B374E/AF794FA2/1AA15" vheight=" 155.25pt" vwidth=" 207pt" orisrc="/__local/E/59/E0/A34B4B110681D11655E7E7312F2_352AC68A_40D23.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 207pt; height: 155.25pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US">3月28日周五/五号楼数学与统计学院 白旭清控制中的数学问题，论文写作指导</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 207pt; height: 155.3pt;"><img src="/__local/5/B1/93/9B79DFFF2E843EC086961F5A39C_A3E86BAA_1B72B.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/5B1939B79DFFF2E843EC086961F5A39C/A3E86BAA/1B72B" vheight=" 155.33pt" vwidth=" 207pt" orisrc="/__local/F/A2/81/7648C04080D9651DEFE74890A59_F876F01D_4CA01.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 207pt; height: 155.33pt;"></span><span id="_GoBack"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></article></section>
